for each	python	For	PY-COMPOUND-STMTS The for statement: the statement of that grammar; canon .templates.mtsv 4-statements holds python For
for each	javascript	ForOfStatement	ECMA-262 14.7.5 The for-in, for-of, and for-await-of Statements: the statement of that grammar; canon .templates.mtsv 4-statements holds javascript ForOfStatement
until	python	While	PY-COMPOUND-STMTS The while statement: the statement of that grammar; canon .templates.mtsv 4-statements holds python While
